# Direct dependencies, pinned to the versions this tree is tested against.
#
# `requirements.txt` beside this file is generated from it and is what anything
# installing this project should use -- it pins every transitive dependency too
# and carries hashes, so a build resolves to the same bytes today and in six
# months. Regenerate after editing here:
#
#     uv pip compile requirements.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#         -o requirements.txt
#
# Exact pins rather than floors: with `>=` a green CI run said nothing about the
# next one, because the next one resolved against whatever PyPI served that
# morning, and a nightly failure could not be told apart from a supply-chain
# event.
